enter;\">Asparagine</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">(III)</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">(D)</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Alanine</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">(IV)</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>"}, "options": [{"id": "3899d4", "text": "(A)&ndash;IV, B&ndash;I, (C)&ndash;II, (D)&ndash;III", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f822ee0e063d9292f07"}, {"id": "7a4215", "text": "(A)&ndash;I, B&ndash;III, (C)&ndash;IV, (D)&ndash;II", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f822ee0e063d9292f08"}, {"id": "df0d07", "text": "(A)&ndash;III, B&ndash;I, (C)&ndash;II, (D)&ndash;IV", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f822ee0e063d9292f09"}, {"id": "8d0e51", "text": "(A)&ndash;IV, B&ndash;I, (C)&ndash;III, (D)&ndash;II", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f822ee0e063d9292f0a"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f822ee0e063d9292f0b", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60ced5dd19d2aa2b78a3a78c"], "topics": ["60e2fbdc66f9ce3f243b5674"], "concepts": ["60e2fbdc66f9ce3f243b5650"], "question": {"text": "The $\\alpha$-Helix and $\\beta$ - Pleated sheet structures of protein are associated with its :"}, "options": [{"id": "5bc659", "text": "tertiary structure", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f822ee0e063d9292f0c"}, {"id": "969ca4", "text": "quaternary structure", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f822ee0e063d9292f0d"}, {"id": "cd5dc9", "text": "secondary structure", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f822ee0e063d9292f0e"}, {"id": "c2f9ea", "text": "primary structure", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f822ee0e063d9292f0f"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f822ee0e063d9292f10", "type": "singleCorrect", "