l\">&#945;</mi></math> -glucose and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></math> -fructose.", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f822ee0e063d9292f4f"}, {"id": "27ab00", "text": "On hydrolysis, it produces glucose and fructose.", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f822ee0e063d9292f50"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f822ee0e063d9292f51", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60ced5dd19d2aa2b78a3a78c"], "topics": ["60e40fd6f1ef260f84ed1ea2"], "concepts": ["60e40fd4f1ef260f84ed1e61"], "question": {"text": "Given below are two statements:<br /><strong>Statement I :</strong>  D-(+)-glucose $+\\mathrm{D}-(+)$ fructose $\\xrightarrow{-\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}}$ sucrose <br><strong>Statement II :</strong> Invert sugar is formed during sucrose hydrolysis.<br />In the light of the above statements, choose the <em>correct</em> answer from the options given below -"}, "options": [{"id": "292b02", "text": "Both Statement I and Statement II are true.", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f822ee0e063d9292f52"}, {"id": "0c37ab", "text": "Statement I is false but Statement II are true.", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f822ee0e063d9292f53"}, {"id": "43bb90", "text": "Statement I is true but Statement II is false.", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f822ee0e063d9292f54"}, {"id": "e1ffef", "text": "Both Statement I and Statement II are false.", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f822ee0e063d9292f55"}], "questionLabels": []}], "markingScheme": {"_id": "608283e223cf4b3ad8f125e6", "title": "JEE Single Correct", "correctAttempt": 4, "incorrectAttempt": -1, "createdAt": "2021-04-09T08:45:27.797Z", "updatedAt": "2021-07-05T05:39:15.785Z", "__v": 0, "updated_by": "6042252509c5bf34e8a2f178"}, "maximumAttemptLimit": 20, "linkedQuestions": [], "createdAt": "2026-04-14T14:30:26.844Z", "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T14:30:26.844Z", "__v": 0}, "position": 0, "_id": "69de4f822ee0e063d9292f5f"}], "bonusSec